#: scenario5:scenario5_4BDEEDC1_33F0_4AA8_BF5D_2A2E636A7437
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 02aad915c75b09e5dfc323d25437c4aca927a32bb711713be6591c0703772dc9
