msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫The light shining in through the windows is swallowed whole by the darkness,"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫あの時差し込んだはずの光は――再び暗闇に飲み込まれ、⟪k:2⟫消え失せていた。"

#: scenario5:scenario5_9A429384_63EF_448F_BB1E_187BA0AE1A0F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 5645c616ba0e2540082efcdfbce1a846d679dcc3618a7bafc4428255b67bb856
