msgid "⟪k:0⟫as if to say our time together never actually existed."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫まるで私たちの日々が無かったかのように。"

#: scenario5:scenario5_7BA2A239_436E_4B91_8D47_12061A23B019
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ab1940e5e97e1febf96a52a77b5e545a42ac7dfe91353c0a431941bc4d7997b2
