msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫But are these truly my memories?⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Could they not be someone else’s tale,"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫けれど――、⟪k:2⟫これは本当にわたしの記憶なのでしょうか？　⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫誰かの物語ではないの"
"でしょうか……。"

#: scenario5:scenario5_E578400A_DAAA_41D4_ABA9_BF7DC344B131
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 74ee4316d7de260be584b42ebcbbe89609ef17a35f8487088138f37b8fb88926
