msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_E578400A_DAAA_41D4_ABA9_BF7DC344B131"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫like all the others we have seen so far?⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫She was so bright and energetic, and I am "
"neither of those."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫今までと、⟪k:1⟫同じように。⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫……だってわたし、⟪k:4⟫あんな風に明るく笑う女ではありませ"
"ん。"

#: scenario5:scenario5_5C3F8C7A_E687_487E_84F4_63752C402505
