#: scenario5:scenario5_C685EEA4_AC83_46D8_8B2A_9813F2571154
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 77b37220f327c0b5d574eb71b8c9a2b752f402bbcdc27da3a5c536da2a7d4aae
