msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_9FB03DE8_0D5D_4717_8FB2_F44670EFEC03"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I bet that’s why troubadours perform at pubs—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫so they can be near the fire."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫吟遊詩人が酒場でうたうのは、⟪k:1⟫やっぱり暖炉が近くにあるからかしら。"

#: scenario5:scenario5_91496DF8_8BC3_4AFD_A82F_BA2E22FA2CDA
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 8dad452530c9cc4ece555983c15f2739460dd85f12f68b218a7ebd48700d2847
